+## 4. Test plan for when this patch is applied
+
+Run against the RED baseline and report deltas only — new passes must not be presented as a
+green repository.
+
+| Family | Assertion |
+|---|---|
+| Namespace strictness | `{"molecular_profile": {"signatures": {"cosmic_cn_signatures": {"Sig7": 0.4}}}}` raises `Sig7NamespaceError`; it must **not** return 0.4 and must **not** return `None` |
+| Namespace accept | `{"molecular_profile": {"signatures": {"macintyre_cn_signatures": {"s7_diag": 0.4}}}}` returns `0.4` |
+| Flattened refusal | `{"sig7_exposure": 0.4}` raises |
+| Genuine absence | `{"molecular_profile": {"signatures": {}}}` returns `None` -> `UNCERTAIN` |
+| Range | `s7_diag = 1.4` raises; `s7_diag = "high"` raises |
+| QC fail-closed | no `qc_metrics` -> `_check_qc` is `False` -> `UNCERTAIN` / `REPEAT_BIOPSY_IF_FEASIBLE` |
+| QC malformed | `qc_metrics = []`, `qc_metrics = {"mapd": "bad"}`, `mapd = NaN`, `mapd = -1` all -> `False` |
+| QC pass | `mapd = 0.2` -> `True`; `mapd = 0.31` -> `False`; boundary `mapd = 0.3` -> `True` |
+| Regression | with `ZETA_SIG7_PROGNOSIS_ACTIONS_ENABLED` unset, no payload of any shape yields `POOR` or `INTENSIFY_SURVEILLANCE` |
+| Downstream | `test_router` emits no `PROGNOSIS_ALERT` and no IMMEDIATE `LOW_PASS_WGS` for any fixture with the flag unset |
+
+## 5. Ordering constraint
+
+C02 and C03 must be applied **before** `ZETA_SIG7_PROGNOSIS_ACTIONS_ENABLED` is ever set in a
+non-research environment, and the 0.25 threshold must be re-derived on the Macintyre scale with
+out-of-fold operating characteristics before it is compared against anything. On present
+evidence (OOF AUROC 0.6446 for the rule, 0.4108 continuous, adjudicated AUROC 0.421) the
+correct disposition for the Sig7 prognostic branch is **retire**, not repair.
